  "hindi": "और अन्य शास्त्रों में प्राप्त जो विषय प्रसंगवश यहाँ लाए गए हैं, उनकी व्याख्या उन्हीं शास्त्रों के जानकारों से सुननी चाहिए। क्यों? क्योंकि एक ही शास्त्र में सभी शास्त्रों का समावेश करना सम्भव नहीं है।",
  "english": "And as for the matters found in other treatises that have been brought in here as the subject requires, their explanation should be heard only from those who know those treatises. Why? Because it is not possible to comprise all treatises in a single treatise.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "arthavaśāt = 'by the force of the subject/need' (as the topic requires). tadvidya = 'knowers of that', i.e. those versed in the treatises concerned; the text does not name them. 'vidyebhyaḥ' is read as the ablative plural of tad-vidya.",
  "confidence": "medium",
  "type": "prose",
  "line_ids": [
   "Su.1.4.6"
  ],
  "lines_deva": [
   "अन्यशास्त्रोपपन्नानां चार्थानामिहोपनीतानामर्थवशात्तेषां तद्विद्येभ्य एव व्याख्यानमनुश्रोतव्यं कस्मात् नह्येकस्मिन् शास्त्रे शक्यः सर्वशास्त्राणामवरोधः कर्तुम् ॥"
